THE WEEKLY CHERRY · <%= @session_date %>

Hey <%= @recipient_name %>,

<% if @attended %>
<% if @promise.present? %>
You promised to <%= @promise.sub(/\A\p{Lu}(?=\p{Ll})/) { |initial| initial.downcase } %>
<% else %>
No explicit next-session promise was captured for you this week.
<% end %>
<% @feedback.each do |item| %>

<%= item.fetch(:emoji) %> <%= item.fetch(:name) %> → you: <%= item.fetch(:body) %>
<% end %>
<% else %>
<%= @absence_warning %>

<% if @mentions.any? || @feedback.any? %>
The Builders said this about you this time:
<% @mentions.each do |mention| %>
<%= mention %>
<% end %>
<% @feedback.each do |item| %>
<%= item.fetch(:emoji) %> <%= item.fetch(:name) %>: <%= item.fetch(:body) %>
<% end %>
<% else %>
The Builders didn't mention you this time.
<% end %>
<% end %>

<% if @attended %>
🍒 TL;DR
<% @tldr.each do |line| %>
<%= line %>
<% end %>

You can review the session here: <%= @session_url %>
<% end %>

<%= @next_time ? "The next session is on #{@next_time}." : "Next session time: to be confirmed." %>
<% unless @attended %>
<%= @next_meet_url ? "Google Meet: #{@next_meet_url}" : "The Google Meet link will be available on the session page." %>
<% end %>

Sincerely yours,
Rich and Otto Labot
